      "content": "it’s just hard to find a reason to keep doing all this sometimes. everything feels so... accidental. like we’re just these tiny, temporary glitches in a massive, cold universe that doesn't even know we're here. just a bunch of atoms arranged in a way that lets us feel pain and then eventually just stop. it feels kind of pointless to keep fighting just to exist for a few decades of nothing.",
